/result
/result-*
/docker*
pyvex_ffi_parser_cache*

# nix build symlinks anywhere in the tree
**/result
**/result-*

# Zed editor agent rules (auto-generated)
.rules-zed-provided

# Claude Code session artifacts
.claude/

# Per-developer cache for incremental nix-docker layer assignment
# (consumed via NIX_DOCKER_LAYER_CACHE in flake.nix; refreshed
# automatically by PodmanPackaging after each successful build).
/.docker-layer-cache.json
/.docker-layer-cache.json.partial
